\par \par \uc2 Patients who take mifepristone follow up with one or two doses of the generic drug misoprostol, above. PHOTO: Natalie Behring for the Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 Women seeking to terminate pregnancies have increasingly turned to the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill since the Supreme Court's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/how-the-supreme-court-overturned-roe-v-wade-and-abortion-rights-11656081705"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decision overturning Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2  in June. Most abortions in the U.S. are done using the pill, according to the \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2  , a policy group that supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights and tracks national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  statistics.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pill-providers-prepare-to-reach-patients-in-restrictive-states-11652439601?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Access to \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 -inducing }}}\uc2  drugs has emerged as a new \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  battleground. More than a dozen states have banned many or most abortions, including those involving the pill.\par \par \uc2 The Biden administration has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/u-s-urges-pharmacists-to-fill-prescriptions-for-drugs-that-can-be-used-in-abortions-11657730714"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned pharmacists }}}\uc2  that refusing to dispense certain \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medications might violate federal protections against discrimination under some circumstances. Attorney General \uc2 Merrick Garland\uc2  has said he would defend the \uc2 FDA\uc2  's authority to regulate \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills.\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 What lies ahead for the right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  following the Supreme Court's decision overturning Roe v. Wade? Join the conversation below.\par \par \uc2 Meantime, many women have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/websites-selling-unapproved-abortion-pills-are-booming-11661079601"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 obtaining the pills }}}\uc2  from states or countries where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is legal.\par \par \uc2 In 2000, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/SB970157748237129306"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the FDA approved mifepristone's use }}}\uc2  up to seven weeks in a pregnancy and later extended that to 10 weeks. The drug works by blocking the pregnancy hormone progesterone. Patients who take the pill follow up with one or two doses of misoprostol, a generic drug that causes uterine contractions.\par \par \uc2 Under the approval, only doctors and nurses who are certified with the \uc2 FDA\uc2  can dispense mifepristone.\par \par \uc2 The agency had taken steps to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/fda-allows-women-to-get-abortion-pill-by-mail-11639698022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ease access to mifepristone }}}\uc2  in recent years, such as removing in 2016 a requirement that patients see their doctor for a follow-up visit after the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . After the pandemic began in 2020, the \uc2 FDA\uc2  allowed two online pharmacies to dispense mifepristone. The pharmacies are still dispensing it.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FDA\uc2  is expected to decide in the coming months whether to relax restrictions on mifepristone further by allowing bricks-and-mortar pharmacies to dispense the drug.\par \par \uc2 The plaintiffs filed suit after the \uc2 FDA\uc2  had rejected citizen's petitions that had asked the agency to reinstate restrictions around accessing mifepristone or remove it from the market.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit said the \uc2 FDA\uc2  didn't have adequate data on mifepristone use by girls and some of the clinical studies the \uc2 FDA\uc2  relied on required more safeguards for patients, such as an ultrasound to confirm gestational age, than the agency later required.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit also said rates of complications from using the drug\u8212\'20\'14such as bleeding and infection, which are mentioned on the drug's label\u8212\'20\'14haven't been adequately studied, and that emergency-room visits following use of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill are more common than following surgical \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The \uc2 FDA\uc2  has not taken seriously its responsibility to protect women from harm," said Donna Harrison, chief executive of the American Association of Pro-Life Obstetricians and Gynecologists, one of the groups suing.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FDA\uc2  has said that the rate of side effects for mifepristone was less than 1%. It has also said that 26 deaths were reported to the agency out of the 4.9 million women who took mifepristone from its approval in 2000 through June 30, 2021, though the agency didn't specify if the drug caused the deaths.\par \par \uc2 As of June 30, 2022, the \uc2 FDA\uc2  spokeswoman said, the agency hadn't identified any new safety concerns.\par \par \uc2 GenBioPro Inc., a maker of generic mifepristone, had sued Mississippi, challenging state rules that imposed a 24-hour waiting period before taking the pill and required the first pill's use at a clinic. The company withdrew the lawsuit after the Dobbs decision, however, saying the new legal landscape required a new strategy.\par \par \uc2 Laura Kusisto and Sadie Gurman contributed to this article\par \par \uc2 Write to Liz Essley Whyte at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:liz.whyte@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 liz.whyte@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/lawsuit-filed-to-reverse-approval-access-to-abortion-pill-11668796816"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lawsuit Filed to Reverse Approval, Access to \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Pill }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020221118eibi0063h\par }{\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
