hich includes Las Vegas, has tried to connect high inflation and other economic concerns to Nevada's economic shutdown early in the pandemic. Mr. Sisolak said that he ordered the closure of casinos and other businesses in 2020 to protect citizens from an even bigger death toll and that Nevada has regained jobs faster than most other states. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
