\par \par \uc2 Republican candidate Derek Schmidt is seeking to mine Kansas voters' inflation concerns. PHOTO: Dominick Williams for The Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 Local officials said it may take until Thursday or later for all ballots to be counted in Nevada amid issues that included a drenching rainstorm in Las Vegas.\par \par \uc2 Oregon might see its first Republican governor in 40 years, as voters angry about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/oregon-might-elect-a-republican-governor-for-first-time-in-four-decades-11666863003"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 homelessness and crime }}}\uc2  in and around Portland are calling for change. Former Democratic State House Speaker \uc2 Tina Kotek\uc2  and former State House GOP leader Christine Drazan are running evenly, according to polls.\par \par \uc2 Betsy Johnson, a former Democratic state senator running as an independent, is polling far behind but drawing enough support that she could influence the outcome. Political strategists said Ms. Johnson is likely drawing more voters from Ms. Kotek than Ms. Drazan.\par \par \uc2 Kansas Republican Attorney General Derek Schmidt is attempting to unseat Democratic Gov. \uc2 Laura Kelly\uc2  by tying her to President Biden in a state Mr. Trump won 56% to 42% in 2020. He is also seeking to tap into voter dissatisfaction with inflation and the Covid-19 restrictions of 2020.\par \par \uc2 Ms. Kelly touted her {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/in-kansas-governor-race-even-the-democrat-touts-ties-to-donald-trump-11667310073"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 record in office }}}\uc2 , including working with the Republican-controlled legislature. Attempting to position herself as a centrist, she ran ads showing herself standing in the middle of roadways and meeting with Mr. Trump when he was president.\par \par \uc2 Alicia A. Caldwell in Tucson, Eliza Collins in Phoenix, Joe Barrett in Janesville, Wis., and Scott Calvert in Philadelphia contributed to this article.\par \par \uc2 Write to Elizabeth Findell at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Elizabeth.Findell@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elizabeth.Findell@wsj.com }}}\uc2  and Jimmy Vielkind at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Jimmy.Vielkind@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jimmy.Vielkind@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/midterm-elections-2022-results-governors-states-11667863055"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 In Races for Governor, Few States Change Control }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020221108eib8000xk\par }{\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
