\par\par \uc2 Midterm Election 2022\par \uc2 Politics\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Is on the Ballot in Five States in Midterm Elections; Voters in California, Michigan, Vermont, Kentucky and Montana weigh in on proposed measures\b0\par\par\uc2 By Jason French \par \uc2 410 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 November 2022\par 14:51 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 In the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/election/2022/general"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2022 midterms }}}\uc2 , voters in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-features-prominently-in-midterm-elections-after-demise-of-roe-v-wade-11667826002"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 five states will decide on ballot measures addressing \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 \u8212\'20\'14the most on record for a single year, according to Ballotpedia. Voters passed measures guaranteeing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access in California, Michigan and Vermont. Kentucky are deciding if the state's constitution should be amended to declare that it doesn't protect the right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Montana is asking voters whether to require medical care and treatment for infants born alive after an attempted \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In August, Kansas voters {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/kansas-abortion-vote-results-11659440554"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rejected a proposed state constitutional amendment }}}\uc2  that would have ended protections for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 California\par \par \uc2 California's Proposition 1 is expected to pass in the heavily Democratic state and was part of a robust legislative package to ensure California remains a haven for people seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services. Legislators placed the measure to amend the constitution on the Nov. 8 ballot just days after the Supreme Court ruled in June that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 states could decide whether to allow \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Kentucky\par \par \uc2 Kentucky voters are deciding whether to amend the state constitution to declare outright that it doesn't protect the right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The state's trigger ban, which bans nearly all abortions, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 took effect }}}\uc2  after the Supreme Court overturned Roe v. Wade.\par \par \uc2 Michigan\par \par \uc2 Michigan voters {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pushes-some-suburban-women-in-west-michigan-toward-democrats-11666085403"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 will decide whether to enshrine \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights }}}\uc2  in their state constitution, after the Michigan Supreme Court voted 5-2 that an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -access initiative {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/michigan-supreme-court-orders-abortion-rights-proposal-be-included-on-november-ballot-11662674386"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 must be included on the ballot }}}\uc2  after a dispute over a minor technical issue. Michigan has a 1931 law banning nearly all abortions that had been largely dormant for the last 50 years, but the referendum will help determine whether that law can once again be enforced.\par \par \uc2 Montana\par \par \uc2 Voters will decide on a referendum that raises the possibility of criminal charges for healthcare providers unless they take "all medically appropriate and reasonable actions to preserve the life" of a fetus born alive, including after an attempted \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8212\'20\'14a rare occurrence, according to the \uc2 Centers for Disease Control and Prevention\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Vermont\par \par \uc2 Voters will have final say on the amendment, known as the Right to Personal Reproductive Autonomy Amendment, or Proposition 5. The proposal would establish a "right to personal reproductive autonomy," which would include protections around \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , birth-control access and sterilization.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-is-on-the-ballot-in-five-states-in-midterm-elections-11667921098"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Is on the Ballot in Five States in Midterm Elections }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020221108eib80030d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
