\par\par \uc2 Midterm Election 2022\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 's Georgia Senate Campaign Scrambled by Allegations About Past Behavior; Republican candidate's adult son accused him of violence and hypocrisy following a media report, denied by Walker, that he had paid for an  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  in 2009\b0\par\par\uc2 By Lindsay Wise \par \uc2 1,052 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 October 2022\par 19:41 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Georgia Republican Senate candidate \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  is facing allegations of violence and hypocrisy leveled by his adult son on social media, scrambling a high-profile campaign weeks before Election Day.\par \par \uc2 "You're not a 'family man' when you left us to bang a bunch of women, threatened to kill us, and had us move over 6 times in 6 months running from your violence," Christian Walker, a conservative social-media influencer, said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ChristianWalk1r/status/1577104266543497216?s=20&t=BhsyPlvaS3dWOwRnPjh_sg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 on Twitter }}}\uc2  Monday night. The elder Mr. Walker responded later Monday with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/HerschelWalker/status/1577115984452030464?s=20&t=BhsyPlvaS3dWOwRnPjh_sg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 his own tweet }}}\uc2 : "I LOVE my son no matter what."\par \par \uc2 In two videos Tuesday, the younger Mr. Walker accused his father of lying and playing down the violence against his family. His campaign didn't respond to a request for comment on the videos.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Walker, an ex-football star endorsed by former President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , faces Democratic Sen. Raphael Warnock in a contest that could determine control of the evenly divided Senate.\par \par \uc2 The public family drama followed a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thedailybeast.com/pro-life-herschel-walker-paid-for-girlfriends-abortion-georgia-senate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily Beast report }}}\uc2  earlier Monday that Mr. Walker\u8212\'20\'14who has said on the campaign trail that he opposes \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  without exceptions, even in cases of rape, incest or danger to a mother's life\u8212\'20\'14reimbursed a woman for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  he urged her to get when they were dating in 2009.\par \par \uc2 The woman, who the Daily Beast said had asked to remain anonymous, backed up her allegations with receipts from the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinic, a copy of a personal check signed by Mr. Walker for $700 and a get-well card she said Mr. Walker sent with the check. The Wall Street Journal hasn't verified the reporting by the Daily Beast.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/HerschelWalker/status/1577075271470964737?s=20&t=BhsyPlvaS3dWOwRnPjh_sg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 In a statement }}}\uc2  Monday night, Mr. Walker denied that he had paid for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , calling it a "flat-out lie." On Fox News Channel's "Hannity" Monday, Mr. Walker again denied paying for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  but didn't deny sending the check and card.\par \par \uc2 "I send out so many 'get well,' send out so much of anything," Mr. Walker told host \uc2 Sean Hannity\uc2 . "But I can tell you right now, I never asked anyone to get an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . I never paid for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and it's a lie." The Daily Beast said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MEPFuller/status/1577076790258208768"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 it stood by its story }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Privately, Republican strategists working to win back control of the Senate say it is too early to know how the revelations will affect a very close race. Polls have shown Mr. Warnock ahead by about 2 percentage points for several weeks, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://projects.fivethirtyeight.com/polls/senate/2022/georgia/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FiveThirtyEight's average of public polls }}}\uc2 , even as Republican Gov. Brian Kemp holds a 6 percentage point lead, on average, in his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://projects.fivethirtyeight.com/polls/governor/2022/georgia/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reelection race }}}\uc2  against Democratic challenger \uc2 Stacey Abrams\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In a series of tweets Monday and videos posted to social media on Tuesday, Christian Walker said that family members had asked his father not to run for office, knowing his past. "He decided to give us the middle finger and air out all of his dirty laundry in public, while simultaneously lying about it," the younger Mr. Walker tweeted. "I'm done."\par \par \uc2 "I stayed silent as the atrocities committed against my mom were downplayed," the son said, apparently referring to allegations by his mother, Cindy Grossman, that Mr. Walker was physically abusive and had threatened to kill her. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abcnews.go.com/Nightline/story?id=4643971&page=1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mr. Walker has said }}}\uc2  he was suffering from mental illness at the time and had no memory of the events described by Ms. Grossman.\par \par \uc2 Christian Walker said he had previously been on board with his father's Senate campaign because he had been told that his father would take accountability for his past, but he was infuriated by what he said were Mr. Walker's lies.\par \par \uc2 "Family values people, he has four kids, four different women," he said in a video posted Tuesday. "Wasn't in the house raising one of them. He was out having sex with other women. Do you care about family values? I was silent lie after lie after lie. The \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  part drops yesterday, it's literally his handwriting on the card. They say they have receipts, whatever. He gets on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , he lies about it."\par \par \uc2 A pair of runoffs in Georgia decided control of the Senate in 2021, handing Democrats a razor-thin majority, thanks to Vice President \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 's tiebreaking vote. Now, with Georgia once more a crucial election battleground, leading Republican groups said they would stick by Mr. Walker.\par \par \uc2 "We are full speed ahead in Georgia," said Steven Law, president of the Senate Leadership Fund, a super PAC run by allies of Senate Minority Leader \uc2 Mitch McConnell\uc2  (R., Ky.).\par \par \uc2 Mr. Law said the election is about the future of the country. "\uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  will make things better. Raphael Warnock is making things worse. Anything else is a distraction." SLF has invested $37.1 million in ads opposing Mr. Warnock from Sept. 6 through Election Day.\par \par \uc2 The National Republican Senatorial Committee, which has poured about $11 million into the Georgia race, blamed the controversy on Democrats and the media.\par \par \uc2 "When the Democrats are losing, as they are right now, they lie and cheat and smear their opponents," said Sen. \uc2 Rick Scott\uc2  of Florida, chairman of Senate Republicans' campaign arm, in a statement Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 "Herschel has denied these allegations and the NRSC and Republicans stand with him, and Georgians will stand with him too," Mr. Scott said.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Trump also issued a statement Tuesday standing by Mr. Walker.\par \par \uc2 Asked about the controversy surrounding Mr. Walker on Monday, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/bluestein/status/1577086598880976896"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mr. Warnock told reporters }}}\uc2  he would "let the pundits decide how they think it will impact the race." The Warnock campaign didn't respond to requests for further comment Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Walker has spoken openly about struggling with mental health. Before he launched his campaign, his past raised concerns among some Republicans. But after Mr. Trump endorsed him, Mr. Walker pulled far ahead of GOP primary rivals, and Mr. McConnell and other senior establishment Republicans threw their support behind him, too.\par \par \uc2 Write to Lindsay Wise at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:lindsay.wise@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lindsay.wise@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/herschel-walkers-georgia-senate-campaign-scrambled-by-allegations-about-past-behavior-11664912481"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Herschel Walker's Georgia Senate Campaign Scrambled by Allegations About Past Behavior  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020221004eia4005pl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
