\par\par \uc2 Politics and Policy\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Sheryl Sandberg\uc2  Donates $3 Million to \uc2 ACLU\uc2  for  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Rights; The former chief operating officer of \uc2 Meta Platforms\uc2  has said she would spend more time working on philanthropic efforts\b0\par\par\uc2 By Joseph De Avila \par \uc2 483 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 October 2022\par 15:51 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Sheryl Sandberg\uc2 , the former chief operating officer of \uc2 Meta Platforms Inc\uc2 ., is donating $3 million to \uc2 the American Civil Liberties Union\uc2  to help the organization advocate for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 ACLU\uc2  said it would use the funds over a three-year period to defend access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in courts, state legislatures and at the ballot box following the Supreme Court's decision to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturn Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2 , the landmark 1973 decision that established the constitutional right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Few things are more important to women's equality than \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access, Ms. Sandberg said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 "We've only just begun to see the devastating impact that state \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans will have on women's health and their ability to determine the course of their own lives," Ms. Sandberg said. "Now, more than ever, we must keep up the fight to defend our right to choose and protect \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access."\par \par \uc2 Anthony Romero\uc2 , executive director of the \uc2 ACLU\uc2 , said the organization will use the money to educate voters on where their elected representatives stand on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. The \uc2 ACLU\uc2  will also dedicate resources to state ballot measures like the one in Kansas, where {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/kansas-abortion-vote-results-11659440554"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 voters rejected a constitutional amendment }}}\uc2  that would have ended protections for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The midterm elections are the warm-up to the 2024 general election, when \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access will certainly be on the ballot in almost every race," Mr. Romero said.\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court's majority opinion in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s.wsj.net/public/resources/documents/dobbs-v-jackson-womens-health-organization-6-24-2022.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization }}}\uc2  this past summer upended nearly five decades of precedent and allowed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stronger state restrictions to take effect }}}\uc2 \u8212\'20\'14including total \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans.\par \par \uc2 Ms. Sandberg, who was still with \uc2 Meta\uc2  at the time, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/after-roe-v-wade-ruling-companies-reimbursing-medical-and-travel-expenses-for-abortion-risk-blowback-11656109337"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called the high court's decision "a huge setback" }}}\uc2  that jeopardizes the health of millions of women and girls. \uc2 Meta\uc2  said at the time the company would offer travel-expense reimbursements to access out-of-state healthcare and reproductive services for people that lived in states with restrictions on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 During her time with \uc2 Meta\uc2 , the parent of social-media giant \uc2 Facebook\uc2 , Ms. Sandberg became one of the most prominent women in business. Her 2013 leadership book "Lean In: Women, Work, and the Will to Lead" helped make her {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/sheryl-sandbergs-legacy-of-leaning-in-11654128723"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the face of corporate feminism }}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/sheryl-sandberg-stepping-down-from-meta-platforms-11654112778?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Since announcing her departure }}}\uc2  from \uc2 Meta\uc2  earlier this year, Ms. Sandberg has said she would spend more time on philanthropy and working with her foundation, the \uc2 Sheryl Sandberg\uc2  & Dave Goldberg Family Foundation.\par \par \uc2 Ms. Sandberg said she hoped her work with the \uc2 ACLU\uc2  would "persuade more people who support rights for women to act and restore rights that were taken from us."\par \par \uc2 Write to Joseph De Avila at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:joseph.deavila@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 joseph.deavila@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/sheryl-sandberg-donates-3-million-dollars-to-aclu-for-abortion-rights-11664898632"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sheryl Sandberg Donates $3 Million to ACLU for \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Rights }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020221004eia4003pd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
