\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Lindsey Graham\uc2  Defends  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Proposal Despite GOP Worries; Some Republicans would rather focus on economy, border issues headed into midterms\b0\par\par\uc2 By Alex Leary \par \uc2 594 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 September 2022\par 18:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON\u8212\'20\'14Sen. \uc2 Lindsey Graham\uc2  (R., S.C.) defended his proposal {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/lindsey-grahams-abortion-bill-gets-cold-shoulder-from-some-republicans-11663098886"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to ban doctors from performing }}}\uc2  abortions after 15 weeks of pregnancy, even as concerns continued to rise among fellow Republicans worried about the proposal's impact on the midterm elections.\par \par \uc2 "I'm pro-life, even in an election year," Mr. Graham said on "Fox News Sunday." "And to those who suggest that being pro-life is losing politics, I reject that. So, listen to what I'm saying and you decide today who you're with."\par \par \uc2 In June, the Supreme Court {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ended the federal right }}}\uc2  to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , leaving the matter to the states and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/states-prepare-to-quickly-implement-abortion-trigger-laws-11655385028"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 setting off a flurry }}}\uc2  of new \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related laws in state capitals to restrict or protect access. The ruling came as Republicans are hoping this fall {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-ruling-poses-fresh-midterm-challenges-for-democrats-republicans-11656272277"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to win back the Senate }}}\uc2 , currently split 50-50 and controlled by Democrats. About a dozen seats {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/senate-midterm-map-shaped-by-abortion-and-the-economy-11663247187"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are considered competitive }}}\uc2  in the November contests.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Graham introduced his bill on Tuesday, and it swiftly drew criticism from Democrats, who have rallied around \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access following the court's ruling and termed his proposal a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. Some antiabortion Republicans also gave the bill a chilly reception, saying that the proposal, which has no chance of passage, simply served to motivate Democratic voters and that Congress should stay out of the matter for now.\par \par \uc2 Last week, several top Republicans including Senate Minority Leader \uc2 Mitch McConnell\uc2  (R., Ky.), said \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy should be left to the states. Sen. \uc2 Mike Rounds\uc2  (R., S.D.) echoed those comments Sunday.\par \par \uc2 "I think right now we should allow the states to explore the different possibilities about the appropriate way," he said on CNN's "State of the Union."\par \par \uc2 The intensity of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -access issue for Democratic voters has posed a problem for GOP candidates, many of whom want to emphasize the economy, crime and immigration instead. Mr. Graham's announcement last week was seen as a distraction from the release of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/us-inflation-august-2022-consumer-price-index-11663017630"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 worse than expected inflation numbers }}}\uc2 , which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/global-stocks-markets-dow-update-09-13-2022-11663065625"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sent the stock market tumbling }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/meet-the-press/first-read/poll-abortion-trump-boost-midterm-prospects-democrats-rcna48173"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new poll out Sunday }}}\uc2  from NBC News showed Republicans with big advantages among voters on the economy, crime and border security, while Democrats were heavily favored on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and healthcare.\par \par \uc2 Any \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bill would require 60 votes to advance in the Senate. Mr. Graham, who had previously said the matter should be left us to the states, said his bill was needed as a response to a legislation passed earlier this year by House Democrats that would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/house-set-to-vote-on-bills-protecting-abortion-access-11657896570?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ensure a right to an \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  through fetal viability, or around 21 to 24 weeks. That, too, lacks votes for passage in the Senate.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Graham, who had previously wrote legislation banning \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 20 weeks, defended his effort to pass federal laws.\par \par \uc2 "I'm not inconsistent," he said. "To suggest that I'm new to the game opposing late term \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is ridiculous."\par \par \uc2 Mr. Graham has said his bill wouldn't apply the ban to situations involving rape or incest or when a mother's health is at risk.\par \par \uc2 A Wall Street Journal poll conducted in August found that 57% of voters opposed a ban on abortions at 15 weeks that included an exception only for the health of the mother. The survey showed opposition from 38% of Republicans, 55% of independents and 77% of Democrats.\par \par \uc2 Write to Alex Leary at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:alex.leary@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 alex.leary@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/lindsey-graham-defends-abortion-proposal-despite-gop-worries-11663524124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lindsey Graham Defends \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Proposal Despite GOP Worries }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220918ei9i00209\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
