\par\par \uc2 Politics and Policy\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Veterans Affairs to Provide  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Services for Health Dangers, Rape and Incest; The VA for the first time in its history will provide abortions at federal facilities, even in states that have outlawed the procedure\b0\par\par\uc2 By Ben Kesling \par \uc2 655 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 September 2022\par 19:39 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The Department of Veterans Affairs, for the first time in its history, will provide \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services and counseling to veterans in cases of health dangers, rape and incest, including at federal facilities in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 states that have outlawed the procedure }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The department, whose healthcare reach spans the country and U.S. territories, announced the policy in an interim final rule Friday that it said allows for immediate implementation of the new policy.\par \par \uc2 "Pregnant veterans and VA beneficiaries deserve to have access to world-class reproductive care when they need it most," VA secretary \uc2 Denis McDonough\uc2  said. "That's what our nation owes them, and that's what we at VA will deliver."\par \par \uc2 The policy is the latest signal that the Biden administration is aiming to challenge states that have banned or heavily restricted \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the Supreme Court's decision in June that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overruled Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2  and ended the constitutional right to the procedure.\par \par \uc2 The VA said that if clinicians face legal action in states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been outlawed, the Justice Department will step in. "If it ever becomes necessary, VA will work with DOJ to ensure the full strength of the federal government is available to defend eligible VA employees," a VA spokesman said.\par \par \uc2 The move drew criticism from the GOP.\par \par \uc2 "This proposal is contrary to longstanding, settled law and a complete administrative overreach," said Rep. \uc2 Mike Bost\uc2  (R., Ill.), the top Republican on the \uc2 House Committee on Veterans' Affairs\uc2 . "I oppose it and am already working to put a stop to it."\par \par \uc2 Rep. \uc2 Mark Takano\uc2  (D., Calif.), the chairman of the House committee, said the new policy puts the VA "on par with all other federal healthcare programs."\par \par \uc2 When the VA last considered the issue in-depth in the late 1990s, it declined to provide \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services at its facilities, knowing that veterans and beneficiaries had legal access to abortions in their communities, the department said.\par \par \uc2 "VA is taking this action because it has determined that providing access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related medical services is needed to protect the lives and health of veterans," the department said.\par \par \uc2 About a dozen states have banned many or most abortions following the Supreme Court's decision.\par \par \uc2 Some federal agencies face restrictions on using government funds to pay for abortions, under a policy known as the Hyde Amendment. But since 1994 the amendment has included exceptions for rape, incest and the health of the woman, the VA said. And the department isn't subject to the Hyde restrictions in any event, it said.\par \par \uc2 The VA serves approximately 300,000 women of childbearing age, according to a VA spokesman, the fastest-growing demographic the department serves. It didn't have an estimate of the number of women who might seek \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services.\par \par \uc2 Since the Supreme Court's decision, the Biden administration has focused on seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access for women facing threats to their health, or who were victims of rape or incest.\par \par \uc2 The Justice Department last month sued Idaho to challenge the scope of its near total ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , arguing the state measure violated a federal law that required hospitals and doctors accepting Medicare to provide emergency treatments, which can sometimes include \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A federal judge issued an initial ruling that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/idaho-must-allow-abortions-in-certain-emergencies-judge-rules-11661386919"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sided with the department }}}\uc2  and blocked the state from enforcing its ban in emergency circumstances.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the U.S.\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/michigan-abortion-rights-ballot-measure-falters-at-state-elections-board-11661991648"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michigan \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Rights Ballot Measure Falters at State Elections Board }}}\uc2  (Aug. 31)\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/google-says-maps-searches-will-identify-clinics-that-provide-abortions-11661457587?page=1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Google Says Maps, Searches Will Identify Clinics That Provide Abortions }}}\uc2 (Aug. 25)\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/idaho-must-allow-abortions-in-certain-emergencies-judge-rules-11661386919"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Idaho Must Allow Abortions in Certain Emergencies, Judge Rules }}}\uc2  (Aug. 24)\par \par \uc2 Write to Ben Kesling at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:benjamin.kesling@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 benjamin.kesling@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/veterans-affairs-to-provide-abortion-services-for-health-dangers-rape-and-incest-11662135780"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Veterans Affairs to Provide \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Services for Health Dangers, Rape and Incest  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220902ei92004bl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
