\par\par \uc2 Technology\par \uc2 Tech\par \b \uc2 Google\uc2  Says Maps, Searches Will Identify Clinics That Provide Abortions; Company plans to also label when it is uncertain if a facility provides  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  services\b0\par\par\uc2 By Meghan Bobrowsky \par \uc2 424 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 August 2022\par 19:59 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Google\uc2  said it would identify healthcare facilities that provide \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services in its maps and search functions amid pressure from employees to do more on the issue in the wake of the Supreme Court ruling that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Alphabet Inc\uc2 . unit on Thursday said it has been working on the update for months and will rely on information provided by a business or authoritative data source to label what services a facility provides.\par \par \uc2 "We're now rolling out an update that makes it easier for people to find places that offer the services they've searched for, or broaden their results to see more options," a \uc2 Google\uc2  representative said.\par \par \uc2 Under the updated labeling system, the company said it would add a "Provides abortions" label to places where such services are available. It said it also will label a facility with "Might not provide abortions" when it has been unable to confirm such services are offered there.\par \par \uc2 Representatives from the Alphabet Workers Union last week {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/google-workers-press-company-to-stop-collecting-abortion-data-11660827600"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sent a petition }}}\uc2  to Chief Executive \uc2 Sundar Pichai\uc2  that called on the company to remove search results for crisis pregnancy centers, which it said were misleading to those seeking abortions. Crisis pregnancy centers are typically nonprofits that counsel women against having abortions. The petition was signed by more than 650 workers at the company that had 174,000 full-time employees at the end of June.\par \par \uc2 The petition also called on the company to stop collecting data on users seeking information about abortions. \uc2 Google\uc2  didn't respond to a request for comment about whether it would stop collecting such search data or remove search results for crisis pregnancy centers.\par \par \uc2 Last month, \uc2 Google\uc2  said it would start automatically {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/google-to-delete-visits-to-abortion-clinics-from-users-location-history-11656710884"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 deleting visits to \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  clinics from users' location history }}}\uc2  and make the erasure the default setting. If users want their location data to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics to be saved, they have to turn the feature on going forward.\par \par \uc2 Since the Supreme Court ruling in June, privacy advocates have been raising questions about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-tech-data-privacy-answers-11656520992"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 what the tech giants will do with the vast swaths of data }}}\uc2  they collect on their users. In a case in 2015, messages that a pregnant woman sent to a friend about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -inducing drugs were used against her in court.\par \par \uc2 Write to Meghan Bobrowsky at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Meghan.Bobrowsky@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Meghan.Bobrowsky@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/google-says-maps-searches-will-identify-clinics-that-provide-abortions-11661457587"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Google Says Maps, Searches Will Identify Clinics That Provide Abortions  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220825ei8p005mu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
