\par\par \uc2 Health News\par \uc2 Health\par \b \uc2 Websites Selling Unapproved  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Pills Are Booming;  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  pills can sell on some sites for as much as $500. It isn't always clear who makes them or where they come from.\b0\par\par\uc2 By Dominique Mosbergen and Vibhuti Agarwal \par \uc2 1,169 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 August 2022\par 11:00 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 A murky online market for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills is thriving as some U.S. states tighten \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions.\par \par \uc2 Dozens of websites state they ship \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  drugs anywhere in the U.S. without a prescription, which violates \uc2 Food and Drug Administration\uc2  rules. Most of the sites don't clearly state who operates them or where they get the pills. The operator of one website said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/fall-of-roe-v-wade-upends-abortion-landscape-for-american-women-11656081225"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 demand for \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  pills has surged }}}\uc2  since the Supreme Court removed constitutional protection for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in June.\par \par \uc2 The sites, some registered overseas, are distinct from U.S.-based {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pill-providers-prepare-to-reach-patients-in-restrictive-states-11652439601"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 telehealth operators that prescribe and sometimes ship }}}\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills to patients in states that allow the procedure.\par \par \uc2 Sites selling \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  drugs without a prescription charge as much as $500 for a pack of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills. Medical support isn't included.\par \par \uc2 The websites provide {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pill-orders-increase-even-in-restrictive-states-11658136602"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 access to pills for patients who can't reach a clinic }}}\uc2 , or who live in states where telehealth consultations for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  aren't allowed, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights advocates said. But the unregulated market creates risks, they said, including that the pills arrive too late to be used effectively. People who buy \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills online without a prescription could face criminal charges, particularly in states that restrict the procedure, legal experts said.\par \par \uc2 Some health experts expressed concerns about websites potentially selling bogus drugs or not providing adequate information and medical support. "You don't know what you're getting," said Al Carter, executive director of the National \uc2 Association of Boards of Pharmacy\uc2 , which represents state pharmacy boards.\par \par \uc2 Two medications, mifepristone and misoprostol, are typically used in a medication-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  regimen, which the \uc2 FDA\uc2  has approved for up to 10 weeks of pregnancy. Websites selling \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills without a prescription are mainly selling pills that haven't been reviewed by the \uc2 FDA\uc2 , according to descriptions on the sites and information from buyers. The \uc2 FDA\uc2  has sent complaints to some companies associated with websites selling \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills online.\par \par \uc2 "Drugs that have circumvented regulatory safeguards may be contaminated, counterfeit, contain varying amounts of active ingredients, or contain different ingredients altogether," an \uc2 FDA\uc2  spokesperson said.\par \par \uc2 Studies have shown medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be safe and effective, including when taken without a doctor's supervision. Patients typically take the drugs at home even when they have been prescribed by a doctor. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
