\par\par \uc2 Politics and Policy\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Suspended Florida Prosecutor Sues \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2  to Be Reinstated; Andrew Warren alleges in lawsuit that governor violated his First Amendment rights; DeSantis had said prosecutor neglected his duty and was incompetent\b0\par\par\uc2 By Joseph De Avila \par \uc2 654 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 August 2022\par 20:47 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 A Florida prosecutor is suing Gov. \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2  for suspending him from office over his pledges to not prosecute cases related to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and gender-transition treatments.\par \par \uc2 Andrew Warren, a Democrat who served as the top prosecutor for the state's 13th judicial circuit in Hillsborough County, asked a federal court in northern Florida to order Mr. DeSantis to reinstate him as a state attorney. The lawsuit, filed Wednesday, also asks the court to permanently enjoin Mr. DeSantis, a Republican, from retaliating against Mr. Warren.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/florida-ron-desantis-suspends-prosecutor-andrew-warren-abortion-gender-transition-cases-11659629739#phrase-auto-person?ref=PERSON%7CWarren%2C%20Andrew;onlineSignificance=prominent"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mr. DeSantis suspended }}}\uc2  Mr. Warren earlier this month for pledges he made to decline prosecuting cases involving violations related to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and gender-transition treatments. That suspension amounted to an abuse of power and a violation of his First Amendment rights, Mr. Warren said at a news conference Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 "\uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2  is hoping to overturn the results of a fair election, throwing out the votes of hundreds of thousands of Floridians," said Mr. Warren, who was first elected in 2016 and was re-elected in 2020. He was one of 20 state attorneys in Florida. "By challenging this illegal abuse of power, we can make sure that no governor can toss out the results of an election because he doesn't like the outcome."\par \par \uc2 The governor's office didn't return a request for comment Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Mr. DeSantis has said he suspended Mr. Warren for neglect of duty and incompetence. "State attorneys have a duty to prosecute crimes as defined in Florida law, not to pick and choose which laws to enforce based on his personal agenda," the governor said earlier this month. "It is my duty to hold Florida's elected officials to the highest standards for the people of Florida."\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit says the justifications included in Mr. DeSantis's executive order suspending Mr. Warren failed to show that the prosecutor was incompetent or neglected his duty.\par \par \uc2 Mr. DeSantis signed the order on Aug. 4 and cited joint statements signed by Mr. Warren regarding potential crimes related to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and gender-affirming procedures.\par \par \uc2 After the Supreme Court {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2 , Mr. Warren signed a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s.wsj.net/public/resources/documents/FJP-Post-Dobbs-Abortion-Joint-Statement.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement }}}\uc2 , along with other prosecutors, regarding the enforcement of state \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws. "Enforcing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans runs counter to the obligations and interests we are sworn to uphold," the joint statement said.\par \par \uc2 Florida passed a law that went into effect in July {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/florida-gov-ron-desantis-signs-15-week-abortion-ban-into-law-11649961049"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 banning abortions after 15 weeks }}}\uc2  of pregnancy. The law includes exceptions for medical emergencies or "fatal fetal abnormalities." It doesn't include exceptions for rape or incest.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Warren also signed a statement in June 2021 with other prosecutors that related to the rights of transgender people and gender-affirming procedures. "Bills that criminalize safe and crucial medical treatments or the mere public existence of trans people do not promote public safety, community trust, or fiscal responsibility," the letter said.\par \par \uc2 The executive order signed by Mr. DeSantis said this statement demonstrates Mr. Warren's incompetence, but also noted that Florida had no such law.\par \par \uc2 The statements Mr. Warren made regarding \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and transgender rights are protected speech under the First Amendment, the lawsuit said. Mr. DeSantis's suspension of Mr. Warren was in retaliation for expressing his views, in violation of the amendment, the lawsuit said.\par \par \uc2 Mr. DeSantis's executive order also cited policies instituted by Mr. Warren related to prosecutorial discretion for certain criminal violations. The order said Mr. Warren's "blanket refusal" to enforce criminal law amounted to a veto on state law.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Warren's lawsuit said the policies were carried out on a case-by-case basis and weren't a blanket refusal.\par \par \uc2 Write to Joseph De Avila at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:joseph.deavila@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 joseph.deavila@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/suspended-florida-prosecutor-andrew-warren-sues-governor-ron-desantis-to-be-reinstated-11660760861"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Suspended Florida Prosecutor Sues Ron DeSantis to Be Reinstated }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220817ei8h005eh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3