\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Federal Trade Commission\uc2  has said that it will begin considering new ways to protect consumer data. PHOTO: Ting Shen for The Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON\u8212\'20\'14A data-marketing and analytics company has sued the \uc2 Federal Trade Commission\uc2  , saying the agency is wrongly threatening to sue it for marketing geolocation data that might be used to track consumer visits to sensitive locations such as \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit by \uc2 Kochava Inc.\uc2  was filed on Friday in U.S. District Court in Idaho, where the company is based.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FTC\uc2  didn't immediately respond to requests for comment. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/ftc-launches-effort-to-expand-online-privacy-protections-11660232848"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commission announced last week  }}}\uc2  that it would begin considering rules to protect the privacy of a range of consumer data.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Kochava\uc2  case represents an early salvo in what could be a lengthy battle over the privacy of some online healthcare data.\par \par \uc2 In June, the \uc2 U.S. Supreme Court\uc2  eliminated the constitutional right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturning the 1973 Roe v. Wade  }}}\uc2  decision and leaving the question of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 's legality to the states.\par \par \uc2 In response, President {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/biden-to-sign-order-stepping-up-efforts-to-protect-access-to-reproductive-care-11657278000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Biden issued an executive order  }}}\uc2  encouraging the \uc2 FTC\uc2  to take new actions to protect consumers' privacy when they seek information about \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive health\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Kochava\uc2  's lawsuit says that in recent weeks, the \uc2 FTC\uc2  sent \uc2 Kochava\uc2  a proposed complaint for permanent injunction that alleges the company has engaged in unfair or deceptive practices.\par \par \uc2 According to the lawsuit, the \uc2 FTC\uc2  claims \uc2 Kochava\uc2  's data makes it possible "to track consumers to sensitive locations, such as therapists' offices, addiction recovery centers, medical facilities, and women's \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive health\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics."\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is one of the services commonly offered at \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive health\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics.\par \par \uc2 Kochava\uc2  said in a statement on Monday that the federal agency's threatened lawsuit against it is a "manipulative attempt\u8230\'20\'26to give the appearance that it is protecting consumer privacy despite being based on completely false pretenses."\par \par \uc2 Kochava\uc2  said it has recently introduced a new capability in its service that is aimed at improving consumer privacy, a privacy block that removes health services location data from its marketplace, and that the \uc2 FTC\uc2  doesn't understand how its business works.\par \par \uc2 The company said it believes the \uc2 FTC\uc2  hoped to pressure it into a settlement to set a precedent in the industry.\par \par \uc2 In another action related to the Supreme Court ruling, the Justice Department earlier this month filed a lawsuit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/justice-department-files-lawsuit-challenging-idaho-abortion-law-11659463607"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 challenging Idaho's near total ban  }}}\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Write to John D. McKinnon at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:john.mckinnon@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 john.mckinnon@wsj.com  }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/idaho-company-sues-ftc-claiming-agency-threatened-suit-over-its-tracking-data-11660608782"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Idaho Company Sues FTC, Claiming Agency Threatened Suit Over Its Tracking Data  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220816ei8g0002t\par }{\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
